; PocketTopo to Survex SVX; conversion profile 1.
; Recorded dates are unverified; no date or CRS is inferred.
*begin
*units default
*calibrate default
*case preserve
*truncate off
*flags not duplicate not surface not splay
*data normal from to tape compass clino
*infer equates on
; trip 0 ticks=0 declination_raw=-4096
; comment "signed declination"
; reference 0
*fix 0_0 0 0 0
*declination -22.5 degrees
0_0	0_1	1	22.5	0
0_1	.	1	112.5	0
0_1	.	2	22.5	90
0_1	0	0	0	0
0_1	0_1	0	0	0
*end
